# Darmstadtium · Ds · gate 110

**Darmstadtium** (Ds) is element **110** of the periodic table — a **transition metal**, period 7, group 10, d-block, solid (predicted) at standard conditions, atomic weight **[281] (most stable isotope)**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
Named for Darmstadt, the city of its making; gone in moments.

## The gate (silicon layer — the 118 Gates)
